<td id="S5.T6.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S5.T6.2.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">95</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T6.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
